Error [E0204]: `d.title` is already lent to this call, so `pair` can't take it here too
  --> take_while_lent_field.jet:10:26
    |
 10 |     print(pair(d.title, ^d.title))
    |                          ^^^^^^^
 Why: An earlier argument lets `pair` read `d.title` for the whole call, so this argument can't hand the same value over
 Fix: Pass a copy to one of the two parameters with `d.title.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
